; tiny_helper: a downstream OCaml library built on top of the Tiny
; binding. Demonstrates that intra-binding repacking composes — the
; library presents its own idiomatic surface to consumers, while
; transitively keeping libtiny.so on its dynamic-link chain through
; the Tiny binding's stub.a.

